# quantum-vault - Chrome Extension Wallet UI

Stack: React 19 + Vite + Manifest V3 + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui (New York) + @project-eleven/libqc.
Package manager: pnpm only. Never yarn or npm.

Commands:
- pnpm dev - Vite dev
- pnpm build:dev - build to build/
- pnpm l:c / pnpm l:f - ESLint check/fix
- pnpm p:c / pnpm p:f - Prettier check/fix

Provider order (CRITICAL): CurrencyProvider -> WalletProvider -> ScreenProvider.
Screen registry in src/screens.tsx. ScreenKey derived from screens object.
WalletProvider owns single LibQC instance via useRef. Popup fixed at ~400px.
